window.products.push({"id":912066,"name":"Serta | Electric Heated Cuddler Wrap Throw with Pockets & Digital Controller, Cloud","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lc53f-9IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functionality is what the Serta Cuddler electric heated wrap is all about. Whether it's wrapped around your shoulders, core, or legs the soothing warmth will provide the level of comfort that you need. Deep pockets are constructed within the wrap to insure your hands will always be warm as well. Made with 100-percent plush polyester fabric makes it exceptionally soft, durable and machine washable. This wrap is ideal for relaxing in bed, watching TV, or working at your desk. Wrap measures an oversized 26-by-74 Inch. The easy to use controller has 4-heat settings to dial in your own personalized comfort level. The controller comes standard with a 14.6-Foot power cord to conveniently reach your position. Forget to turn it off? we've added a 4-hour automatic shut off for added safety and Peace of mind. Comes with a 1-year manufactures warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lc53f-9IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serta","source_asin":"B013EHJQKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013EHJQKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013EHJQKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
