window.products.push({"id":912124,"name":"Sushi Making Kit For Beginners – DIY ALL IN ONE Sushi Maker Set Make Sushi at Home like a Pro Sushi Chef- Sushi Kits Amazing Gifts For Birthdays","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q8YYrj8FL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"🍱ALL IN ONE SUSHI MAKING KIT - Package include Sushi Bazooka, 2 Bamboo Sushi Rolling Mat, Rice Paddle, Spreader, Sushi Knife, 4 Bamboo Chopsticks Set, 4 Chopsticks Holder, Avocado Slicer. A Complete sushi bazooka kit that provides everything you need to make sushi, in just a couple of minutes 🍣EASY TO USE THAN EXPECT: The sushi kit is the ideal innovative sushi that is easy to use and original. Rolling sushi is easier with this package than you would expect. Only open the sushi bazooka, add the rice and the other ingredients, close it and squeeze the long tube out of it. Pretty handy! Directly apply seafood ingredients or roll up the sushi tightly with the natural bamboo mats made with seawater. 🥢NATURAL BAMBOO MATERIAL: Each product included in the sushi Kit is constructed of top quality bamboo material. All sushi mat rollers are put together by 100% high-quality cotton threads to make sure that there are no splinters and no unraveling of the cotton string stitching. 🎉ENJOY YOUR SUSHI PARTY: Not only can you make the different tastes you want, you can also share with family and friends the joy of making sushi. With your kids, you can also cook sushi rolls. It will teach something new to your children, and improve the fine motor skills of their hands. Sushi-making is a friendly new skill that can be experienced by anyone. 💸SAVE YOUR TIME AND MONEY: As we know that sushi in a restaurant is costly, why not try to do it yourself at home? All the supplies for making sushi are part of our sushi making package. In rice, you can add kinds of ingredients, although you choose lots of sushi flavour, it's really saving money. The sushi bazooka offers the fastest way to produce sushi in a few minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q8YYrj8FL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ravel","source_asin":"B08SCJPQ4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SCJPQ4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SCJPQ4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
