window.products.push({"id":912182,"name":"Yerba Mate Bombilla Straw Set of 2 with Cleaning Brush | Reusable Stainless Steel Straws | Bombilla Mate Set for Yerba Mate Gourd | Premium Quality","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810meWDiFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yerba Mate pronounced (yer-bah mah-tay) has a rich history with origins from Northern Argentina, Paraguay, and Southern Brazil. It is a tea-like infusion that is known for its rich nutritional benefits, taste profile, and method of drinking. Enjoyed by millions around the world, including well-known celebrities such as Leo Messi, Luis Suarez, Viggo Mortenson, Kevin Bacon, James Hetfield, Barack Obama, Diego Maradona, Ricardo Arjona, Madonna, Gisele Bundchen, Tom Brady, and Pope Francis. Yerba Mate is renowned for its ability to naturally increase concentration, mental clarity, and endurance. Traditionally consumed with a Gourd called Mate and a straw called Bombilla which you will find in this set. A cleaning brush is also included for easy cleaning and maintenance. Our other product, a Stainless Steel Yerba Mate Gourd Cup/Set is the most traditional way to drink Yerba Mate Infused Tea. It can be prepared with hot water (the most traditional method), with ice-cold water, french press or as a hot or cold brew. Enjoy your mate! Quantity: 2 Bombilla (Yerba Mate Straws) & 1 Cleaning Brush Dimensions: 8.66 x 3.93 in Materials: Stainless Steel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810meWDiFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Norte Group","source_asin":"B08JFW9J3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JFW9J3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JFW9J3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912183,"name":"Bellaa Vintage Camera bookends, Decorative Book Ends for Bookshelves, Rustic and Vintage Decor for Home, Office Desk, and bookcases Decoration, Handma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWdZz1esL._AC_SL1404_.jpg","description":"Save your books - don't let your heavy collections fall from your desk shelf with these elegant book ends. These book stops can hold even the heaviest of books! Specially made for bookworms, book lovers, enthusiasts, collectors, and bibliophiles. Organize with style - Bellaa specializes in handmade, decorative, artistic, antique, vintage, and rustic bookends giving off a super cool look and boho feel. Adds a nice touch to your bookshelf, table, corner desk, or coffee table. Made durable enough to handle everything you throw at them, including heavyweight hardbacks. Vintage Camera design - hand painted and born out of our love for interior decorating, books, pipes, and vintage finds. These bookends have been given a protective coating to prevent chipping and water damage due to moisture, spillage, rain, or snow if placed outside on patios or balconiesc Perfect for any room - these decorative bookends are a great addition to your home office, study space, display rack, bar, and look great on shelves. Use these sturdy yet elegant bookends as display pieces anywhere in your home, and show off all of your collections neatly, and organized with ease. These book stoppers also make the perfect gift for men, women, friends, and family. Made to last - Our book holders are made with durable polyresin resin and an attractive design that looks great in any room and makes it sturdy enough to hold even large books, vinyl records, files, and folders. Polyresin is scratch-resistant and doesn't absorb odors or moisture. We care about your satisfaction so if you're unhappy with our product please let us know! Every one of our customers is important to us, if you're unhappy for any reason please let us know so we can rectify the situation quickly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qWdZz1esL._AC_SL1404_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellaa","source_asin":"B018P7IZCE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018P7IZCE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018P7IZCE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
