window.products.push({"id":912200,"name":"Portable Humidifiers for Bedroom Small Humidifier-300ml Cool Mist Humidifier for Plants, Mini room Humidifier for Bedroom,Desk Humidifier for office,Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yBZiSy5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable Mini Humidifier-Small humidifier for bedroom with mini compact design allows you take it to anywhere,just turn on the humidifier, and enjoy better, healthier air. Safe- The desktop humidifier will automatically shut-off when the water level is low. You can use the personal humidifier at night without worrying about safety. Two Spray Modes-The plant humidifier indoor has two mist modes: Intermittent Mist and Continuous Mist. A full water tank could support 4 hours in continuous mode, 6 hours in intermittent mode. Quiet Colorful Night Light- 7-colorful soft night light could create a sweet and romantic sleeping atmosphere, improve your sleep quality!This baby humidifier operate at low than 32dB almost silent frequency,which will not affect your work and sleep.Small humidifier for plants with Perfect for Baby bedroom, office, car to provides moist air and moisturize dry skin. 【Warm Tips 】- ①Travel humidifiers is recommended to use clean tap water or mineral water, Do not use essential oils,perfume, distilled water, which will cause the cotton swab to clog and the Humidifier to be unusable. ②Easy to clean humidifier please make sure the cotton core has soaked a few minutes to let it faster absorb enough water before you turning it on. ③Any quality problem, please do feel free to email us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yBZiSy5BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KJRIVER","source_asin":"B0BM9LQFK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9LQFK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9LQFK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912201,"name":"Dragon Ball Z Goku Bento Lunchbox - Stacking Bento Box with Spoon, Chopsticks, Elastic Strap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KpoT3yfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A fun, funny and useful gift for Dragon Ball Z fans of all ages.For those of you with fond memories of the show, and / or with kids who are fans, Just Funky has the accessory for you. Whether you’re on the hunt for magical dragon balls or just off to the office, why not have Goku by your side (or in your briefcase), for a spot of fun during the day.Picnics, school lunches or office snacks are guarded by Goku and a nice strong elastic strap.Stash a sandwich, spreads and veggies, even salads and rice-based meals. You have two BPA-free plastic compartments that will keep everything sealed and safe from being squashed. You even get utensils in the form of a pair of chopsticks plus a sturdy spoon. Indulge your fandom, and add this to your cart now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KpoT3yfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUST FUNKY","source_asin":"B07RTYTJ7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RTYTJ7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RTYTJ7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
