window.products.push({"id":912357,"name":"Kitchen torch, Cooking torch,Sous vide torch,Powerful MAPP Propane Culinary Blowtorch Trigger Start Campfire, for Searing Steak Suitable Outdoor Campi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YZQqpxgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【How to Use】the trick is to open the valve so slightly that the tiniest hiss can be heard, then ignite. Now it works every time. The idea is that if the valve is open slightly too much the propane shoots out past the spark flamethrower. But if you open the propane valve the absolute tiniest bit, there will be propane for the igniter flamethrower. 【Wide Applicability】 Kitchen Cooking Torch can be used with propane, MAPP, MAP-Pro gas, fits most propane tanks on the market, comes with detailed instructions to let you know how to use and store your propane torch. (Butane or Propane Tank Not Included） 【Powerful Heat Output】Kitchen Cooking Torch flame temperature can reach up to 2000°F, flame size can be adjusted and controlled by knob, fully burns and scorches food quickly, making food more palatable and attractive, handheld high power propane torch is perfect for fast BBQ food. Simply light the charcoal and join your outdoor party with your friends along with a juicy steak. 【Portable and Handheld】The Kitchen Cooking Torch has ergonomically handle with balanced weight center provide an easy grip, and the kitchen torch's trigger located at handle allowing one-hand operation.for Cooking It's small enough to fit into your kitchen drawers, RV, or in your backpack for outdoor adventures. 【GREAT GIFT & VERSATILE 】 Great for sous-vide cooking, Searing torch can used in searing steaks, roasting bell peppers, sous vide, glazing a baked ham, caramelizing sugar, and melting cheese in culinary. Lightingharcoal, grill, campfire, and ire place in daily life. Glass blowing, welding, melting metal as hobbies and work multiple camping applications","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YZQqpxgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEUEK","source_asin":"B0B7WQ5B8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7WQ5B8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7WQ5B8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
