window.products.push({"id":912448,"name":"Sports 8 Disk Set for Cookie Presses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UzW4CzLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"► Welcome to Impress! Bakeware. Impress! Bakeware is a small, family-owned company run by two moms who are passionate about spritz cookies! We design adorable, beautiful, whimsical and wonderful cookie press disks for YOU to get creative with! ► We are so excited to be back! We have been busy making changes and are excited to announce that we have added an Impress! Cookie Press to our product line. We have also made some changes to our disks and added some new designs. ► Our new Impress! Cookie Press is a classic press style, featuring lightweight metals with a beautiful high gloss aluminum barrel, so it’s easy to clean and light in your hands. Our top and bottom attaching rings have a smooth, gliding movement for easy assembly, refilling and disk changing. The lever has a smooth motion and is easy to operate. Our Impress! Cookie Press comes with 12 unique disks that are a mix of classic and creative new shapes. ► With over 200 new and unique designs of cookie press disks you can now get creative with your cookie press (or our new Impress! Cookie Press) all year long! See new DISK SIZING information since we have switched from our size M and size P disks to our new ONE SIZE disks. This one size is meant to fit our new Impress! Cookie Press although be sure to check our DISK SIZING information to see what existing presses our new disk size fits. ► Making spritz cookies means no messy floured surfaces like cutout cookies, and pressing cookies is faster and easier than using cookie cutters. Our Impress! Cookie Press Disks allow you to make dozens of new shapes of cookies that are sure to Impress your family and friends. ► Our disks are made with a special 3/32\" thick, highly durable, BPA-free plastic material that create consistent, detailed shaped cookies. ► All of our disks come with a basic Spritz cookie recipe to get you started, as well as decorating ideas and cookie press troubleshooting tips. Happy baking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UzW4CzLCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impress! cookie press disks","source_asin":"B089CXKSQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CXKSQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CXKSQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912449,"name":"ADVANCED LIVING Silicone Wearable Nail Polish Bottle Holder (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SD8cY2LBL._AC_.jpg","description":"This nail polish holder is small enough to fit in a makeup bag and weighs less than one ounce. tweexy is made of 100% soft, flexible and comfortable silicone rubber. Does not stretch out or tear and will retain its original shape for years and years. It allows you to reach every drop of polish by tilting your hand. An affordable Mini Luxury Product, a Must Have for every busy female with an on-the-go lifestyle. Great for Bridesmaids, Hostess Gifts and Stocking Stuffers. This solves the problem of drips, spills and the inconvenience of reaching for the bottle. The bottle is always inches from your nails. Transfer this nail polish holder from hand to hand without fear of smudging. Cleans with soap and water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41SD8cY2LBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISTOYO","source_asin":"B01ENU8M7A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ENU8M7A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ENU8M7A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912450,"name":"storeindya Handcarved Wooden Screen Room Divider 4 Panel 72 X 80'' Fully Reversible Highly Versatile Hides Clutter Durable Folding Partition Bedroom L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pUybM0DNL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","description":"Store Indya is a travel quest to unravel the forgotten hand crafted skills of India… Store Indya was something that was created as a result of family trips we took across India. While travelling, we not only saw different cultures in different parts of India, but we also realized each corner of India has its own secret. They all have their own unique art forms that’s known to only a very few in India, and almost unknown to the rest of the world. We discovered that these age-old glorious skills are getting suppressed. The artisans that we work with are trying to continue the dying legacy of their artwork. Each artwork handcrafted by them is an end product of their hard and meticulous work. Store Indya wants to revive these art forms and at the same time empower these skilled artists. We want to present different art forms and create a whole new product by itself that has never been created before. Overall, these products not only stand for aesthetics and traditions, but the designs on it also represent various socio-cultural issues that we want to talk about with the world and even encourage others to talk about it by gifting these handicrafts to one another. We want our products to not just sit quietly, looking pretty in a corner of your home, but in fact speak your mind. We at Store Indya believe in – “Design to empower.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pUybM0DNL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"storeindya","source_asin":"B079W6CM9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079W6CM9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079W6CM9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
