window.products.push({"id":912493,"name":"High Top Window Film Static Privacy Decoration Self Adhesive for UV Blocking Heat Control Glass (Style 2, 17.7in by 78.7in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rp-aQytNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"(Please note that Lines Run Verticle, Not Horizontal) Package Includes: 1 x Window Film Instruction: 1. Measure the size of your window. Cut the film into proper size, approximately 1 inch larger; 2. Clean your window thoroughly; 3. Wet the window completely; 4. Peel off the backing protective film; 5. Post the film on the window glass carefully; 6. Squeeze out all the bubbles and water inside (can use a Plastic card to do it); 7. Dry off your window with a rag entirely, cut the excessive edge carefully. 8. Paste edge carefully. Done. Tips for Installation: A clean and smooth glass surface without any dust, fiber or any kind of texture is needed. A clean and smooth glass surface without any dust, fiber or any kind of texture is needed. The transparent back cover must be peeled off; otherwise, the film will fall off when the water is dry. The transparent back cover must be peeled off; otherwise, the film will fall off when the water is dry. Do not apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. Do not apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. The film may be a little tough and its adhesive effect will be impacted in winter. Solution: use hair dryer or warm water to soft it. ( Heat resistance is under 176℉). The film may be a little tough and its adhesive effect will be impacted in winter. Solution: use hair dryer or warm water to soft it. ( Heat resistance is under 176℉). Q: How long will this film last for? A: In normal condition, it will last for 2 year on the window. Q: Why there is bubbles inside? A: Because the water is not clean out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completely. Q: Could this film be used for more than one times? A: Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rp-aQytNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"High-Top","source_asin":"B0777PWV9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777PWV9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777PWV9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
