window.products.push({"id":912554,"name":"DG Casa Koa Modern Accent Chest Cabinet Table with 2 Doors & Adjustable Height Storage Organization Shelf for Hallway, Entryway, Living Room, Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":297.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GFt1byGhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crisp and modern, the Nikolas Accent Chest in Oak is a storage cabinet that will bring a modern touch to your entryway, living room, foyer or bedroom. It can also be adorned as a hallway cabinet with it’s console style. Featuring chevron-style designed doors in a premium oak finishing, it offers just the right amount of storage with a smooth top surface, ultimately providing the perfect platform for all of those special décor details. The double doors feature premium push to open hardware to reveal adjustable interior shelving to accommodate a variety of storage needs, making it the perfect storage companion. This chest measures 15.5 by 39 x 35.5 inches and comes with floor guides for the ultimate floor protection. The Nikolas Accent Chest in Glossy White is certain to bring the striking, old-world-charm and functional statement to your home that you’ve been looking for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GFt1byGhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DG Casa","source_asin":"B09K9N5XHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K9N5XHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K9N5XHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912555,"name":"FBS Lift Chair Motor Actuator Assy for Single Motor Chairs LMD6208,Black/Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":205.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GVwR2MDeL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","description":"This is the most common FBS actuator used on standard, single motor lift chairs in the last few years. This actuator has two leads, one male two (2) prong flat blade/round blade connector that plugs to a cord going to the transformer, and another female five (5) pin plug that the cord from the hand control plugs into. The most common problem with this motor is that the metal connector will break off on the end of the stroke tube that pushes the chair up & down. PLEASE NOTE: there are several different FBS actuators that have the LMD6208 designation; this one will replace many of these actuators, but not all. If your chair has two motors, this one may not be the correct one. Also, if the tube connector is not broken, and your motor is not even trying to run, IT IS VERY DOUBTFUL THAT THE MOTOR IS THE PROBLEM, as these motors hardly ever go out when they are dead silent... We check each motor before it leaves our shop to make sure that it is running correctly, so if you get this motor, plug it in before you install it; and if it doesn't run, then the problem is elsewhere in the chair. Usually, the problem is in either the hand control or the transformer. If any questions at all, please let us know before you place your order. - Most Common Actuator Used on Newer Pride Lift Chairs - WIll Have a Stcker That Says LMD6208 - Has Two Leads, one 2 Prong Flat Blade/Round Blade, and a 5 Pin Female Plug - PLEASE SEE IMPORTANT PRODUCT DESCRIPTION INFORMATION BELOW BEFORE ORDERING!! Item Weight: 6 pounds Item Weight: 6 pounds Product Dimensions: 18 x 8 x 6 inches Length (inches): 18 Width (inches): 8 Height (inches): 6","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GVwR2MDeL._AC_SL1498_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FBS","source_asin":"B01M0KQYD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0KQYD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0KQYD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
