window.products.push({"id":912732,"name":"JamBer Chef Blow Torch Culinary Butane Torch Refillable Cooking Torch Kitchen Handheld Torch with Safety Lock&Adjustable Flame Lighter for Crème Brule","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmBgFszQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for A Gift for Your Friends or Family? Give them the best kitchen gadgets! JamBer Culinary Butane Chef Torch ---The Amazing Refillable Cooking Kitchen Blow Torch With Safety Lock & Adjustable Flame ever! How to use: 1.Gas-refilled: please insert the Butane Gas Refill bottle vertically to the blow torch bottom as shows in picture , wait for 6 secs once and then pull out, 3 ~4 times operation will fully refill blow torch, wait for minutes then blow the fire. 2.Light up : First and Important, turn counterclockwise to open gas valve, then press the button to light up. 3.Adjust the Flame and Temperature:When the flame is burning, flame can be changed between strong blue flame and gentle orange flame, allow you to control in order to get just the right temperature for meal preparation. 4. Two ways to turn off: When the butane gas is burning, release the flame lock button to turn off the flame, or just turn clockwise to the end and the flame will go off also. Specifications: - Capacity: 16g butane gas - Flame Temperature: Up to 1300°C / 2500°F - Made with Aluminum alloy - Flame size: 10~10 cm - Product size: 18 x 14 x 6.5 cm/ 7.0*5.5*2.5 inch - Net weight: 0.75lb Precautions: - Please have a rest when continuously burning for every 5 minutes to prolong lifespan . - Keep out of reach of children, face of other people, yourself and inflammable articles while using. -Turn the Fire Ignition toward the end and turn off the air valve when you are not using the blow torch. - Avoid direct sunshine for long hours or place it at the place over 50 Celsius degrees.  - Use acceptable butane gas, otherwise it is possible to break the lighter or shorten service life. BUTANE GAS ONLY. Package includes: 1 x Blow torch (butane gas not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MmBgFszQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JamBer","source_asin":"B07BF79QWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BF79QWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BF79QWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
