window.products.push({"id":912773,"name":"Wonder Junior Basic Hand Mill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uOu36bnTL._AC_.jpg","description":"*** Burr grinder, clamp, flour guide, and flour brush sold separately (or as part of Deluxe model) *** For years hand mills have either been really cheap or really expensive. Unfortunately their ability to perform has been directly related to their cost. The cheap ones perform poorly and the expensive ones perform great. When we designed the Wonder Junior we wanted the versatility and high quality of the most expensive mills in a price range that was affordable. The Wonder Junior is the highest quality most versatile hand mill available. You can create super fine flour or coarse cracked grains for cereals. By swapping the stone heads for the stainless steel burr heads you can make delicious nut butters, grind flax or other oily/wet grains, herbs/spices, soy beans, legumes, and even coffee! In all these applications you are assured to always have the perfect fresh ingredients for your family even if the power is out. Professionals agree that the Wonder Junior is THE mill to own. The Wonder Junior has amazing features at a very reasonable price. The whole mill is powder-coated making it safe to wash (easy clean up). The large octagon hopper holds over one quart. Because the mill is one piece you don't have to worry about the hopper coming off during milling like other models. The heavy-duty double clamp attaches to tables/counters up to 2” thick. Once you clamp it down it never moves. The mill uses lifetime lubricated bearings and it has a heavy base that can be bolted to any table/counter. The Wonder Junior is extremely easy to use. You simply load the easy-fill hopper, turn the handle, and you'll get flour. There are no small parts or gaskets to misplace. Cleaning the mill is quick and easy. For added peace of mind, a Limited Lifetime Warranty is included with every Wonder Junior from the company which has been making quality electric mills for over 10 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uOu36bnTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonder Junior","source_asin":"B0026TG610","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0026TG610","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0026TG610","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
