window.products.push({"id":912803,"name":"BIG SALE OFFER Set of 2, 100% Authentic Copper Mug with FREE Copper Shot Glass And Copper Straw - 16 oz Copper Moscow Mule Mug - Solid Copper Bar, Coc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hNpvf24gL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Why use Pure Copper? Pure copper is essential for the chemical ionization of acids found in citrus fruits such as limes, lemons, and oranges. For this reason, other mugs that have stainless steel linings or are coated with food lacquer or nickel do NOT have the same taste as drinking from a pure copper mug.At Kitchen Classique, we take great pride in the authenticity and craftsmanship of our products. Your new Moscow Mule mug is made from 100% copper without any lining. Don't drink from a cheap imitation--you deserve better. Free Copper Shot Glass and Copper Straw We've created the perfect mug for all of your cocktail and drinking needs, but we didn't stop there. With your purchase of the copper mug we'll include a FREE 100% copper shot glass and Copper Straw! Not only is this shot glass sleek and shiny, it allows you to create your cocktails in pure copper, giving your drink a head-start on the ionization process and making it extra delicious. With your purchase. Classic Moscow Mule Recipe 6 oz. ginger beer2 oz. vodkaHalf a lime Pour the ginger beer and vodka over a generous amount of ice cubes. Squeeze the lime into the mix and stir. Add lime slice for garnish. Warranty If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, we'll give you a 100% refund within 90 days of purchase. You the customer are our highest priority, and we're only happy if you're happy. We are standing by 7 days of the week to answer any questions or issues you might have. Click Add to Cart to get your very own 100% Copper Mug TODAY","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hNpvf24gL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dungri India Craft","source_asin":"B01AW9AZLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AW9AZLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AW9AZLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
