window.products.push({"id":912806,"name":"Xtreme TB224DKO 224-Disc CD/DVD Case (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177FZ542YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Portable CD/DVD wallet holds 224 CDs/DVDs, or 112 with booklets, in double-sided storage sleeves. Xtreme accessory cases combine technology with style, providing consumers with ways to organize their multi-media collection. Amazon.com Why settle for small CD wallets that carry only a tiny fraction of your music and movie collection when you can carry over two hundred discs at once? This Xtreme CD/DVD case is built to hold as many as 224 discs--giving you a huge selection for long road trips--yet takes up only as much space as the average coffee table book. Each of the case's 28 double-sided storage sleeves can stow up to eight discs (four on each side), or listeners can configure them to hold CDs and DVDs in half the pockets and booklets in the other half. More importantly, the case protects your media from damage thanks to its sturdy rubberized outer layer that's resistant to heat, moisture, and tearing. The durable construction ensures that your discs are perfectly safe even if you forget them in your car on a warm afternoon. The interior of the case also contributes to your discs' wellbeing, as each sleeve is lined with a soft, scratch-free backing. Once you're ready to hit the road, merely zip up the closure for safekeeping and grab the reinforced rubber handle. So whether you're stocking up on music and movies for a cross-country drive or you just want to do away with jewel cases and compress your collection, this Xtreme case is a perfect fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177FZ542YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Extreme","source_asin":"B0007P4G6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007P4G6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007P4G6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912807,"name":"Yumkfoi Steel Braiding Hair Rack – Adjustable Height, 168 Pegs Hair Extension Holder, 3 Sided Standing Braid Rack Separator with 5 Wheels and 1 Storag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nelH8W8BL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STURDY & DURABLE】Made of carbon steel, strong and durable, made to last for long years. Unlike other top-heavy braiding racks, the bottom adopts five-foot base, made of hard plastic, more stable than the ordinary base, never worry about tipping over or wobbling during use. Black painted exterior, stylish and elegant, suitable for any home or salon decoration style 【LIFTABLE & ROTATING】The top section is 360 degrees rotating for easily grabbing hair on each side. The height is adjustable from 47 - 55 inch to comfortably suit different sitting or standing heights, protecting your body from bending over or reaching far from the hair. Equipped with 5 universal wheels for easy movement and convenient usage 【3 SIDED LARGE CAPACITY】3 sided design, a total of 168 pegs, super capacity fully meets your braiding needs, do not need to restock hair repeatedly. It additionally offers a roomy storage shelf (36L) to accommodate your braiding hair supplies, keeping all your hair braiding tools or hair products within reach when braiding 【MULTI PURPOSE】Suitable for hairstylists, braiders, professionals, salons or braiding enthusiasts at home, you can enjoy braiding hair for yourself, your loved ones or your clients; Also a perfect gift given to your mother, daughter, or hairstylist friends during birthday, wedding, anniversary, Thanksgiving, Christmas, holiday and other special days 【TIME SAVING】Hold up to 168 extensions for an easier and faster application. Prepare hair in advance without having to stop and restock frequently, add precision and efficiency in the braiding job by having each extensions well organized, let you win more customers in shorter time especially when having busy hair appointment schedule","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nelH8W8BL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yumkfoi","source_asin":"B0BLC86294","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLC86294","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLC86294","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
