window.products.push({"id":912831,"name":"Pinion Pins White Magnetic Duvet Clips with Magnetic Key for Easy Removal. Pack of 8 Comforter Fasteners That are Safe Locking and Holds up to 10lbs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AwY1GqgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INNOVATIVE MAGNETIC PINNING SYSTEM - Pinion Pins feature an easy release magnetic pinning system that makes unpinning your duvet fast and secure! Never wake up with your comforter, blanket, or duvet in a bunch again. These pins are perfect to use as duvet donuts, comforter pins, and to secure bedding! 10LBS OF SECURING STRENGTH - Simply put the pin through the materials you want to connect. Place the backer on the pin and it will hold in place with over 10lbs of strength! MULTI PURPOSE USE - Try Pinion Pins on other fabrics too! You can use Pinion Pins to hang decorations, pin curtains, securing furniture slipcovers and much more! ENOUGH FOR 2 BEDS - This package comes with 8 duvet pins. Use left over pins to secure curtains, pin comforters, and hold couch covers in place. PATENTED DESIGN - Most Duvet fasteners are difficult to remove. Pinion Pins include a magnetic key for easy removal! Simply use the included magnetic key to remove the backer. Our Pinion Pins have a unique design, protected under patent #10,136,704.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AwY1GqgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinion Pins","source_asin":"B07L45CNY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L45CNY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L45CNY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912832,"name":"Mermaid Babe 30oz Stainless Steel Tumbler Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Hot and Cold Travel Mug with Leak Resistant Lid, 2 Reusable Drink Straws, Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"<!DOCTYPE html> <html> </style> <body> <span style='font-size:20px;'>👓</span> </body> </html>Stay Hydrated in Style with Mermaid Babe – Designed for all those on-the-go lifestyles our insulated tumblers keep drinks hot, cold, fresh, and tasty which makes it great for home, work, gym, sports, or travel use. <!DOCTYPE html> <html> </style> <body> <span style='font-size:20px;'>☕</span> </body> </html>Ice Water, Cold Brew, Hot Coffee, and Beyond – Our 30 oz tumbler is designed to support all your favorite brews and drinks including water, juice, milk, fresh-brewed tea, hot or iced coffee, and so much more. It also helps retain fresh flavors. <!DOCTYPE html> <html> </style> <body> <span style='font-size:20px;'>👙</span> </body> </html>Flip-Top, Leak-Resistant Drink Lid – Great as a travel tumbler. Our cup comes with a multipurpose lid that lets you drink out of the spout or slide in one of the included straws to sip straight from the top. Perfect for kids, teens, or adults. <!DOCTYPE html> <html> </style> <body> <span style='font-size:20px;'>🌊</span> </body> </html>Double-Wall, Sweat-Free Tumbler Design – A smart way to keep drinks cold or hot for hours our cute tumbler come in five brilliant colors and are vacuum insulated to eliminate condensation or “sweat” for an improved grip and temperature retention. <!DOCTYPE html> <html> </style> <body> <span style='font-size:20px;'>🌴</span> </body> </html>Drink Accessories for On-the-Go People – Each of our insulated travel tumblers comes with straight and curved stainless steel reusable straws (2) as well as a high-quality straw cleaning brush, so you can avoid using disposable plastic straws.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mermaid Babe","source_asin":"B0B8XKJ6HJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8XKJ6HJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8XKJ6HJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
