window.products.push({"id":912857,"name":"Personalized Bottle Openers - 3PCS Custom Bottle Openers Stainless Steel Ace Card Engraved Bottle Opener Poker (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XxJppwHSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features: The perfect addition to any poker game.  The wallet beer bottle opener has all your bottle-opening needs covered!  Use the cleverly crafted heart hole in the center of the metal card to flick the tops off your bottles (and look super cool at the same time).  Credit card size, you can put it in your wallet.  You will never need to look for a bottle opener.  Compact and easy to carry.  Reliable and upgraded design, the workmanship are exquisite.  Good reliability and lifelong lasting time, very useful and durable. Specification: Material: Stainless Steel Color: Silver, Black Size: 8.5cm*5.4cm Thickness: approx. 1mm Package included: 1 x Poker Bottle Opener Notes: Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. We guarantee the style is the same as shown in the pictures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XxJppwHSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHIVENIDO","source_asin":"B07XSL4Z91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XSL4Z91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XSL4Z91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912858,"name":"Kitchenelli Cooking Utensils Set - 22 Piece Premium Tool and Gadget Set Made of Lightweight Stainless Steel and Durable Black Nylon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tu6keEjSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everything you need to cook like a chef Our silicone cooking utensils set will allow you to cook like a real chef in your own kitchen. This stylish and multifunctional set can help you cut, crush, whip, decorate and so much more. Cooking with quality utensils is easy and fun. Healthy homemade food will be prepared faster and more easily with Kitchenelli kitchen gadgets. A full set of utensils for cooking and baking The heat-resistant non-stick silicone cooking utensil set consists of: turners, tongs, spatulas, pizza cutter, whisk, bottle and can opener, grater, measuring cups and spoons – 22 pieces. Practical, convenient, safe This premium quality set of cooking utensils is made of safe and reliable materials: stainless steel and nylon. Materials do not absorb smells and can be used daily for all types of cooking. The perfect combination of bright silver steel and black nylon elements will look great in your kitchen. Gentle on your dishes and food The Kitchenelli cooking utensil set does not scratch cookware, does not stain and can withstand high temperatures. Present a quality set of utensils to your friends or family Looking for a great gift for friends, colleagues, relatives or neighbors? The Kitchenelli steel cooking utensil set is the best gift for any holiday. This useful, attractive and very functional set of utensils will appeal to all! Really good deal The good price for the quality Kitchenelli cooking set and a full refund or product replacement if unsatisfied, make your purchase easy, beneficial and risk-free. Your 100% satisfaction with Kitchenelli cooking supplies is our goal and we will do everything we can to help you get the best steel cooking utensil set .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tu6keEjSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchenelli","source_asin":"B06XVH4NVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912858","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XVH4NVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XVH4NVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912859,"name":"BALLARINI Bellamonte Cast Iron 5-qt Oval Dutch Oven - Crema White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612ofW-fAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BALLARINI infuses the rich tradition of Italian cuisine into a contemporary line of enameled cast iron cookware, at an attractive price that makes them an ideal option for those just starting out with cast iron. Bellamonte Dutch ovens are also the perfect choice for the practiced home chef looking to expand their cast iron collection. Cook big batches for family and friends, then serve right to the table in these elegant Dutch ovens.The Dutch oven is ideal for simmering hearty stews, and frying chicken on the stovetop without messy splatter, or baking bread and roasting veggies to tender perfection in the oven. Featuring a heavy, self-basting lid, food is always moist, tender, and full of flavor. Available in a variety color inspired by Italian flavors, there’s a style that fits every kitchen aesthetic.Bellamonte enameled cast iron brings authentic Italian heritage to the modern kitchen. The elegant white cream interior possesses exceptional heat-retaining qualities, so the pot heats evenly throughout. The enamel coating is ultra-durable and scratch resistant so you can enjoy your cookware for longer. The exquisite brass-hued lid knob is adorned with the Rivarolo city gate, the iconic emblem of BALLARINI. Serve directly to the table in this stunning Dutch oven that features oversized handles for easy control and maximum maneuverability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612ofW-fAXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALLARINI","source_asin":"B0BBJR9Q2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBJR9Q2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBJR9Q2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912860,"name":"Venigo Digital Meat and Food Thermometer for Cooking and Grilling, Waterproof Instant-Read Cooking Thermometer, Kitchen Probe Thermometer for Baking, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GyhuYMK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ FAST & ACCURATE READINGS - Measure food or drink temperature in as little as 3 seconds with an accuracy of +/- 1 degree with the Venigo Meat Thermometer and it can easily switch between ℃ and ℉. Read temperature measurements more easily in low light with the help of the illuminated LED display. ✅ WATERPROOF & DURABLE - The Venigo Meat Thermometer has a waterproof rating of IPX6, so you can rest assured that it will not be damaged by water. To wash it, simply clean it with a wet cloth or rinse it under the tap. Our thermometer features a strong, food grade stainless steel probe that folds up for convenient storage. ✅ USER-FRIENDLY & COMPACT - To use, just open the probe and the device is ready to go! The LCD display screen is easy and clear to read. The compact design allows you to store it easily and travel with. The thermometer features a magnetic back so you can attach it to a refrigerator or any metal surface, as well as a hanging hole for kitchen hooks or a lanyard. ✅ LOCK & CALIBRATION - The kitchen thermometer can lock the current temperature and keep it displayed once the probe is removed from your food so that you no longer have to risk peering into a dangerously hot oven or grill. The calibration function can adjust the probe sensor so that you will always get a correct reading, making our thermometer last a lifetime. ✅ VERSATILE THERMOMETER - The Venigo thermometer is designed for cooking steaks, chicken, poultry, beef, pork chops, roasted meat, soup and seafood, etc. It also helps to check the liquids temp cooked in the cold or hot conditions. The quality and convenience of our food thermometer makes it a great present for any BBQ enthusiast! ✅ TRY RISK FREE TODAY! - All of our thermometers are a great blend of innovation, design, and build quality. Included in your purchase is one Venigo Meat Thermometer plus 2 batteries (CR2032) and a 12-Month Warranty. If you have any questions about the product, please contact our friendly customer service and we will respond right away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GyhuYMK8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Venigo","source_asin":"B0BCW628X2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCW628X2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCW628X2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":912861,"name":"Dikolre Shoe Rack Organizer for Closet Entryway, 3-Tier Bamboo Stackable Shoe Rack Small Shoe Storage for Dorm Front Door Wooden Shoe Shelf, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K0-Dad4qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to Assemble: Everything needed is included so there is no need to look for tools. Dikolre 3-tier bamboo shoe rack adopts a tenon joint design, and the upper and lower racks are embedded in grooves to connect, then use the tiny Allen wrench to screw screws into tight holes. You can install it within 8 minutes. Solid Bamboo Materials: Bamboo is a stronger material than wood and will last longer. Thus, we choose renewable resource bamboo that grows in natural alpine areas. The texture is strong load-bearing, stable and durable. Each layer of the shoe rack can bear a weight of 40 Lb. After the product is carbonized at a high temperature, it is waterproof and not easy to crack and deform. Simple & Versatile: There is no doubt that this bamboo 3-tier shoe rack will keep your shoes organized. In addition, its unique design style makes it suitable for most living scenes. It can be used as a bookshelf or flower stand in the living room or bedroom, it can be used as a towel rack in the bathroom, it can even use to hold small organizational boxes of crafting supplies, or anywhere else you need to store things. Stackable Design: Whenever trying to save space or make room, we find ourselves stacking things one on top of the other. Dikolre shoe rack was designed with perfect tenon design without stacking tools. As you see the top shelf has a little protrusion that allows for stacking. The shoe racks are connected by embedding grooves between the upper and lower frames. You can stack them to save space in the room while gaining additional storage. Quality Customer Service: Thanks for shopping at Dikolre, you didn't just get a great product--you also supported the growth of the Dikolre, which is pretty cool(at least we think so). In the past 16 years, Dikolre cherish every customer who trusted us, we hope your shopping experience is better than ever before, and we are standing by to help you if you have any problems! To make you 100% satisfied is our developing goal!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K0-Dad4qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dikolre","source_asin":"B0B3S1VB7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3S1VB7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3S1VB7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
