window.products.push({"id":912964,"name":"Wall Mounted Toothbrush Holder, Toothbrush Holders for Bathroom with 2 Toothpaste Dispensers, Cups, Large Capacity Tray, Cosmetic Drawer and 4 Brush S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XU0MpvyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑【All-IN-1 Toothbrush Holder】The wall mount toothbrush holder built in 2 automatic toothpaste dispenser which squeezing out certain amount of toothpaste you need, preventing waste of toothpaste. Multifunctional toothbrush holder also with mouthwash cups, large capacity tray, cosmetic drawer and 4 brush slots with cover. Not only you can store combs, toothbrushes, toothpaste, soap, razors, etc., but also put commonly used cosmetics and accessories to keep your bathroom clean and tidy. ☑【Upgraded Design Magnetic Mouthwash Cups】Multifunctional toothbrush holder made of high quality material. There are upside-down toothbrush slot and Magnetic adsorption toothbrush cup design for fasting water draining to keep the bottom of your electric toothbrush and cup dry as you no longer have to worry about stagnant water touching its base. ♥【Large Capacity -Save Space】Toothbrush holder wall mount with automatic toothpaste dispenser can accommodate multiple cups and 4 toothbrush slots for family use and easy to clean.You can put toothpaste, Shaver, facial cleaner and cosmetic on the large countertop. Moreover, an extra drawer is designed to storage your eyelash curler, lipstick or other small accessories. ☑【Upgraded 2 toothpaste dispensesrs】The 2 toothpaste dispensesrs of toothbrush holder for couple to distinguish the toothpaste of morning and evening. The dispenser squeezes with vacuum extrusion pump provide a large amount of power just need to push gently the rod of dispenser by your toothbrush to get perfect amount toothpaste each time. Put an end to waste! Toothpaste dispenser saves up to 30% that is usually wasted in toothpaste tubes and other products. ♥【Easy to Install and Clean】The wall mount toothbrush holder is easy to dismantle for cleaning as well as easy to put back together, streamline the look of your bathroom counter and keep your shower stall and bathroom sink clean and tidy. Toothbrush holder is attached with strong seamless stickers. Easy to install, no drilling and no tools. Please note that this sticker is only applicable to surfaces such as smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. ❤【GUARANTEE PROMISE】Bathroom wall mounted toothbrush holder comes with a 12-month warranty. Please feel free to contact us with any questions or problems about the toothpaste dispenser holder. We guaranteed reply within 24 hours. Any quality problem of all the toothbrush holder will be solved with good service. We will spare no effort to provide you with a 100% customer satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XU0MpvyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coniengk","source_asin":"B09XJXP6G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-912964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XJXP6G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XJXP6G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
